OL,3,GNEWSANew link road 'could bring 1,000
OL,4,Ajobs' to area
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new roundabout and link road designed
OL,7,Fto improve access and attract
OL,8,Fbusinesses has opened.
OL,10,FThose behind the project hope the
OL,11,Fimprovements to the B1135 at Hethel,
OL,12,Fnear Wymondham, will open up 20
OL,13,Fhectares (49 acres) of land to new
OL,14,Fbusinesses as well as improve access to
OL,15,FHethel Engineering Centre.
OL,17,FThe project received #8.4m of
OL,18,Finvestment from the Greater Norwich
OL,19,FGrowth Board Infrastructure Investment
OL,20,FFund, Norfolk County Council and South
OL,21,FNorfolk Council.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
