OL,3,GNEWSANew link road 'could bring 1,000
OL,4,Ajobs' to area
OL,5,
OL,6,FConservative leader of South Norfolk
OL,7,FCouncil, Daniel Elmer, said it "has the
OL,8,Fpotential to deliver over 55,000 square
OL,9,Fmetres of new employment space, support
OL,10,Faround 1,000 additional high-value
OL,11,Fjobs, and help unlock #750m of direct
OL,12,Finvestment".
